        <mxCell id="band-L0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6A86;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;arcSize=5;fillColor=#F3F4F7" value="&lt;b&gt;L0 FOUNDATIONS&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="1360" x="20" y="669" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;The skill bundles: what exists, what is needed, and how they depend on each other&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot;&gt;Dependencies point down only. Each skill is complete on its own; a repository composes the bundles it wants in .agents/skills.json and answers each skill&#39;s bindings in .agents/skill-bindings.toml.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="1340" x="24" y="3" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot;&gt;Repositories that install bundles and bind them, in one of two styles: an architecture repository of its own beside an implementation, or the architecture under docs/ of the component&#39;s own repository.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="96" width="186" x="24" y="78" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot;&gt;Needed. Scaffolds or validates a solution&#39;s architecture against the continuum, composes the bundles below into it, and keeps the architecture and the implementation aligned.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="96" width="206" x="24" y="222" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot;&gt;The architecture artefacts and their definitions, from the platform landscape to the deployment node.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="116" width="172" x="24" y="352" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot;&gt;How work, research, patterns and planning are done. Each stands alone.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="116" width="172" x="24" y="502" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot;&gt;The installer and bundle format, the diagram model and the deck renderer.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="94" width="172" x="24" y="691" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pa" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B2A4A&quot;&gt;patternode-architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot; face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;patternode/patternode-architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Style A, the exemplar: an architecture repository of its own. The house profile; implementation links back.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="220" x="210" y="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pp" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B2A4A&quot;&gt;patternode-platform&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot; face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;patternode/patternode-platform&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Implementation: hexagonal contexts, linking back to the architecture. Two repository-local skills.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="220" x="442" y="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ks" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B2A4A&quot;&gt;knowledge-store&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot; face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;patternode/knowledge-store&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Style B, a standalone component: the architecture under docs/ in its own repository, expressed with the continuum first.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="232" x="674" y="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B2A4A&quot;&gt;life-guide-internal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot; face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;patternode/life-guide-internal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Style B today, informally: architecture documents beside the implementation. Installs work and thread only.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="220" x="918" y="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nx" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2A4CDB;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#2A4CDB;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2A4CDB&quot;&gt;The next solution&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot; face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;either style&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Scaffolded from the house profile, aligned by construction, kept aligned by reconcile.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="225" x="1150" y="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sa" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2A4CDB;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#2A4CDB;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2A4CDB&quot;&gt;scaffold-architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Scaffolds or validates an architecture that conforms to the continuum, in a repository of its own or under docs/ of a component&#39;s repository: folders by level, bindings, skills.json, registers, the site. The profile comes from the exemplar.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="413" x="237" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="si" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2A4CDB;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#2A4CDB;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2A4CDB&quot;&gt;scaffold-implementation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Contexts and services from the catalogue in, a hexagonal skeleton out: contract, domain, adapters, service module, one composition root per deployable. Java or Python.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="314" x="662" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2A4CDB;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#2A4CDB;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2A4CDB&quot;&gt;reconcile&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;Architecture against implementation, both ways: contexts, services, contracts and nodes. A drift report, run in CI, that fails when a deployable has no catalogue entry.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="383" x="992" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ac" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B2A4A&quot;&gt;architecture-continuum&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#5a6a86&quot; face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;dermot-obrien/architecture-continuum&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#3a4a66&quot;&gt;One skill, &lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;architecture&lt;/font&gt;, with a flow per construct; today nine &lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;aaa-*&lt;/font&gt; skills, folded into it under the rename. Carries the continuum (docs/continuum.md), the standards each flow reads, the front matter schemas, the architecture ontology, which extends the work ontology, and the definition ladder.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="96" width="1165" x="210" y="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
